"management","s":"Sherry Bahrambeygui","x":"…and logistics side our Costa Rica already see continues to ramp up and we're in the process of streamlining our merchandise flows through this new 166,000 square foot building, which I referenced earlier, and that should allow us to drive efficiencies that we can pass on to our members.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/10/pricesmart-inc-psmt-q1-2019-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"PSMT 2019 Q3","e":"psmt","d":"2019-07-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sherry S. Bahrambeygui","x":"…ways to effectively flow merchandise from our vendors and DCs to our clubs and ultimately to our members taking into consideration various factors, changing dynamics such as China tariffs and ways to maximize the optionality and resources we're building with our regional distribution center.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/11/pricesmart-inc-psmt-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"PSMT 2019 Q3","e":"psmt","d":"2019-07-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sherry S. Bahrambeygui","x":"There's political unrest, there's tariffs, there's tax law changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/11/pricesmart-inc-psmt-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"PSMT 2019 Q4","e":"psmt","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jon Braatz","x":"So Sherry, going back to your core philosophy, it's always been passing cost savings on to the consumer to generate higher revenues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/pricesmart-inc-psmt-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"PSMT 2020 Q2","e":"psmt","d":"2020-04-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sherry S. Bahrambeygui","x":"So we've curtailed discretionary spending, and are considering and planning for additional cost saving measures in the US, and in the markets where we operate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/09/pricesmart-inc-psmt-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"PSMT 2020 Q4","e":"psmt","d":"2020-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael McCleary","x":"We also incurred $1.2 million of severance costs in the fourth quarter, primarily related to structural realignment of certain corporate functions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/pricesmart-inc-psmt-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"PSMT 2020 Q4","e":"psmt","d":"2020-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jon Braatz","x":"…you mentioned that in the fourth quarter, the SG&A costs were, I think you said $1.2 million in severance costs, but Sherry you mentioned that there were also -- you also paid some one-time bonuses sort of recaptured what a repaid what was forgiven in the first two quarters -- first three…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/pricesmart-inc-psmt-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"PSMT 2021 Q1","e":"psmt","d":"2021-01-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sherry S. Bahrambeygui","x":"Driven in part by leadership changes in the merchandising area and restructuring over the last year, the hardlines team did a tremendous job of working with our suppliers anticipating and reacting to changes in demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/08/pricesmart-inc-psmt-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"PSMT 2021 Q3","e":"psmt","d":"2021-07-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sherry S. Bahrambeygui","x":"Also, as I mentioned, we've made strategic investments in inventory to guard against potential future price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/09/pricesmart-inc-psmt-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"PSMT 2021 Q4","e":"psmt","d":"2021-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sherry S. Bahrambeygui","x":"Despite all of these issues, we worked hard to hold down or mitigate the price increases passed on to the members while maintaining sufficient inventory.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/22/pricesmart-inc-psmt-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"PSMT 2021 Q4","e":"psmt","d":"2021-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rodrigo Echagaray","x":"There's been a positive impact from the price increases, and all that has been happening there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/22/pricesmart-inc-psmt-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"PSMT 2021 Q4","e":"psmt","d":"2021-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Rodrigo Echagaray","x":"Are you restructuring?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/22/pricesmart-inc-psmt-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"PSMT 2022 Q1","e":"psmt","d":"2022-01-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jon Braatz","x":"I know you raised prices to account for the currency restrictions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/18/pricesmart-psmt-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PSMT 2022 Q1","e":"psmt","d":"2022-01-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael McCleary","x":"These combined cost savings of 50 basis points were offset by the 50 basis points lower margin contribution I mentioned previously.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/18/pricesmart-psmt-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PSMT 2026 Q1","e":"psmt","d":"2026-01-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Price","x":"First, regarding U.S. tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/15/pricesmart-psmt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PSMT 2026 Q1","e":"psmt","d":"2026-01-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Price","x":"As a result, U.S. import tariffs do not apply to most of our merchandise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/15/pricesmart-psmt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PSMT 2026 Q2","e":"psmt","d":"2026-04-09","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"David 